From: Sidhanta Sahu <sidhanta@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Jun 2025 00:29:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath12k: harden PPE direct-switch lifecycle

Use a wildcard PMAC and a bank with vdev-id checking disabled when a
split-PHY virtual interface shares a PPE VP.  Keep the bank reference in
the VP profile, restore PPE routing registers after UMAC reset, and
reprogram existing VP entries as vdevs restart.  Only the associated STA
link owns the shared AST search entry.

Based-on: cc51c4d638df1d1ab4d1e90c957f4c588e57d577
Link: https://git.codelinaro.org/clo/qsdk/oss/system/feeds/wlan-open/-/blob/1ee3a4ab7c59ceaff347c4668fc6c7604a04c323/patches/ath12k/0348-QSDK-DP-wifi-ath12k-Enable-UMAC-reset-support-for-DS-mode.patch
Based-on: https://git.codelinaro.org/clo/qsdk/oss/lklm/nss-ppe/-/commit/b75a2535c456c487835fd924d088082d1e74d596
Signed-off-by: Sidhanta Sahu <sidhanta@qti.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Ramya Gnanasekar <quic_rgnanase@qti.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Balamurugan S <quic_bselvara@qti.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Balamurugan Mahalingam <bmahalin@qti.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: syed touqeer pasha <spasha@qti.qualcomm.com>
